questions.problem:
Which of the following are affine transformations?

- $$
\displaystyle \mathbf{T}_1 : {\left[ \begin{array}{c}u \\ v\end{array} \right]} \longrightarrow {\left[ \begin{array}{c}u + v \\ v - 2 u + 1\end{array} \right]}
$$

- $$
\displaystyle \mathbf{T}_2 : {\left[ \begin{array}{c}u \\ v\end{array} \right]} \longrightarrow {\left[ \begin{array}{c}u - v \\ v - u\end{array} \right]}
$$

- $$
\displaystyle \mathbf{T}_3 : {\left[ \begin{array}{c}u \\ v\end{array} \right]} \longrightarrow {\left[ \begin{array}{c}u \\ u - {v}^{2}\end{array} \right]}
$$
